flowchart LR
    change([Change ready]) --> checks[Run checks]
    checks --> review{Approve release?}
    review -->|Approved| package[Build artifact]
    package --> staging[Deploy to staging]
    staging --> smoke[Run smoke tests]
    smoke --> production[Promote to production]
    production --> observe([Observe release])
    review -->|Changes needed| revise[Revise change]
